; ===============================================================
;  Cavity RF-jitter tolerance study
;  Three RF gaps with random voltage + phase + frequency errors —
;  a stand-in for LLRF stability budget studies.
;
;  Beam enters at 10 MeV (proton).  Each gap delivers a small
;  energy boost; the per-seed errors create acceleration jitter
;  and longitudinal mismatch.
; ===============================================================
TITLE Cavity RF jitter
FREQ 325
PARTRAN_STEP 100 50
;
; --- Cavity error directive: applies to the next 3 GAPs ---
;     N  r  dx dy φx φy   E    φ   dz
;                       voltage 1 %, phase 1°, no align/dz
ERROR_CAV_NCPL_STAT 3 2 0  0  0  0   1.0  1.0  0
;
; --- Transport line with cavities ---
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 80 4 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 100 20
GAP 1.0e6 -30 20 0      ; e0tl=1MV, phi_s=-30°
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 80 -4 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 100 20
GAP 1.5e6 -25 20 0
DRIFT 100 20
QUAD 80 4 20 0 0 0 0 0 0
DRIFT 100 20
GAP 2.0e6 -20 20 0
DRIFT 200 20
END
